  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_019 (multimodal multiprofile with pca_n2000 RNA, resnet50 image, avgpool, weighted fusion) achieves 0.638 accuracy. This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with the more powerful imagenet_vit_l image encoder and switching to transformer aggregation, which could better capture complex interactions in multimodal data. This balances exploration (testing stronger image features) and exploitation (building on previous multimodal success). The expected cost is higher than config_019 (estimated ~15 GPU hours) but justified by potential accuracy gains from advanced encoders and aggregation."
